    description: "WHAT. Campaigns 3 and 4 were not clean (INV-kazud, INV-simop: both fixed, PRs #2255, #2257), and their counts were muddied by an environment leak between tests (WI-holuj, fixed PR #2258). Run the weighted planted-fault campaign again on a dev with all three fixes, after a full run has folded the index, with a fresh seed (20261120).\n\nHOW. bar/campaign3.py --out bar/campaign5 --per-shape 8 --seed 20261120. Replay every miss alone (bar/replay_misses.py campaign5) and in company (bar/replay_company2.py) before calling it real.\n\nCLOSE CONDITION. Summary in the notebook, by shape: planted, type gate, ran, failed a test, failed tests, kept, named, outside. Zero real misses: WI-pugol may proceed (with the count: a clean campaign bounds the miss rate, it does not prove it zero). One real miss: the selector stays off and the miss is filed."  # 156b
